flowchart LR
    Source["<B>Source Word Document</B><br/><br/>One large document containing:<br/>• Business content<br/>• Meaningful structure<br/>• Presentation formatting<br/>• Embedded images and tables<br/>• Generated table of contents<br/>• Other document-specific elements"]

    Temporary["<B>1. Temporary Markdown Extraction</B><br/><br/>Working representation containing:<br/>• Extracted text<br/>• Headings and subheadings<br/>• Tables<br/>• Image links<br/>• Separately extracted media<br/>• Possible Word and pandoc artifacts<br/><br/>NOT maintained content<br/>NOT canonical content<br/>NOT a published output"]

    Analyze["<B>2. Analyze Source and Temporary Extraction</B><br/><br/>Assess:<br/>• Document size and structure<br/>• Heading hierarchy and topics<br/>• Tables, images, links and references<br/>• Authored versus generated elements<br/>• Potential content loss or extraction defects<br/>• Suitability for ongoing maintenance"]

    Classify["<B>3. Recommend Knowledge Type and Standard<br/><br/>Possible types:<br/>• Manual or manual topic<br/>• Procedure<br/>• Policy<br/>• Training topic<br/>• Other approved type<br/><br/>Select expected metadata, sections,<br/>semantic components and validation rules"]

    Recommend["4. Recommend Canonicalization Approach</B><br/><br/>A. Promote after mechanical cleanup<br/>B. Keep as one file<br/>C. Split into smaller topic files<br/>D. Map into a knowledge-type standard<br/>E. Require manual resolution<br/><br/>Recommend maintainable content structure"]

    Decide{"<B>5. User Decision</B><br/><br/>• Accept or override knowledge type?<br/>• Accept or override organization?<br/>• Confirm proposed content mapping?<br/>• Desired output formats?<br/>• Presentation templates to apply?"}

    Plan["Confirmed Canonicalization Plan<br/><br/>• Source fingerprint<br/>• Knowledge type and standard<br/>• Structural anchors<br/>• Organization and mapping<br/>• Ambiguous-content decisions<br/>• Desired outputs"]

    Canonicalize["<B>6. Canonicalize Knowledge</B><br/><br/>Depending on the approved plan:<br/>• Clean and promote<br/>• Organize and split<br/>• Map into standard sections<br/>• Preserve unresolved content for review"]

    Validate{"<B>7. Validate Canonical Content</B><br/><br/>• No content loss or duplication<br/>• Required structure and metadata<br/>• Valid links and media<br/>• Generated artifacts removed<br/>• Ambiguities resolved or recorded"}

    Canonical["Governed Canonical Content<br/><br/>Authors maintain:<br/>• Business knowledge<br/>• Meaningful headings and structure<br/>• Procedures, tables and semantic components<br/>• Images and essential references<br/>• Author-owned metadata<br/><br/>Markdown is the canonical prose format<br/>with machine metadata stored separately"]

    Generated["<B>8. Generate Derived Elements by Code</B><br/><br/>Not maintained manually:<br/>• Table of contents<br/>• Navigation and breadcrumbs<br/>• Keyword summaries<br/>• Indexes<br/>• Related-topic listings<br/>• Publication metadata"]

    Presentation["<B>9. Apply Destination Presentation Templates</B><br/><br/>Separate from knowledge standards:<br/>• Markdown publication profile<br/>• SharePoint or HTML layout<br/>• Word or PDF template<br/>• PowerPoint presentation profile<br/>• Audio or training profile"]

    Outputs["<B>10. Produce Desired Outputs</B><br/><br/>Canonical Content<br/>+ Generated Elements<br/>+ Presentation Template<br/><br/>• Markdown pages<br/>• SharePoint-ready / HTML<br/>• Word / PDF<br/>• PowerPoint<br/>• Audio or training content<br/>• Future Copilot grounding package"]

    Source --> Temporary --> Analyze --> Classify --> Recommend --> Decide

    Decide -- "Override" --> Analyze
    Decide -- "Confirm" --> Plan --> Canonicalize --> Validate

    Validate -- "Correction or review required" --> Recommend
    Validate -- "Accepted" --> Canonical

    Canonical --> Generated
    Canonical --> Presentation

    Canonical --> Outputs
    Generated --> Outputs
    Presentation --> Outputs

